# Keep the single-image build context small (context = repository root).
#
# NOTE: do NOT exclude apps/web, apps/api or packages — bun.lock lists every
# workspace and `bun install --frozen-lockfile` fails if one is missing, and the
# Go build needs apps/api. The frontend bundle is produced inside the image, so
# a local dist/ is never needed.
.git
.github
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/bin
**/build
**/.turbo
**/tmp
*.md
Makefile
lefthook.yml
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.override.yml
